Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to service school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Lene, your hospitality hostess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you hold on just a moment, Commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission to\Nexploit my servant in this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.55,0:00:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked her to find us\Na qualified instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobles like us don't know the\Nfirst thing about service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta change if\Nwe hope to run a cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine the horror?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go into the Foundation Day Fair\Nwithout any hosting skills to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, thankfully, the problem's solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, as I'm sure you're\Nall aware, I am a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm a servant as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure some of you may find the\Nidea of being taught by me appalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, focusing on status will distract\Nyou from serving your customers properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why, until their\Npreparations are complete...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all will address me as instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.55,0:01:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really expect us to\Ntake orders from a commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take instructions from an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say that, Prince Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then there's this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be a servant to the royal\Nfamily, but he's still a noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,upturned nose and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.98,0:01:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's decided then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all counting on your guidance, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you meant Instructor Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Service is about giving everything to your\Nmaster and expecting nothing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an art crafted from\Nthe sincerest compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read this and enter me when I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Instructor Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the essence of a maid's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Service and devotion, Instructor Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first skill a maid must learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A polite greeting, Instructor Lene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it all together,\Nloudly and clearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:01:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you look at me in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:02:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you two don't think\Nyou're exempt from all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what's more with feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was quite\Nthe ordeal, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had such a\Nfearsome alter ego, Linnaeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, Miss Clare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I did get a bit overzealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, I suppose it\Nshouldn't come as a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always have been quite different from\Nthe other maids since the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your new maid, Miss Clare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will be serving you personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Lene Aurousseau.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that I care what your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I when you'll be\Nquitting within a week anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was a handful from\Nthe very beginning, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.22,0:02:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since her parents were either\Nbusy or traveling all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire wasn't raised with firm\Nvalues or consistent nurturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She became selfish and hard to manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Lene, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop prattling and become a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A horse, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you lack education, but\Ndo not even know what a horse is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what a horse is, but\Nwhy do you want me to be one?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm in the mood\Nto go riding, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, get down on your hands and knees now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, please don't\Nask me to be a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to say\Nyes as you command! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you little - Because nobles\Nshouldn't sully themselves that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't allow someone like you to\Nsit on the back of a lowly, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll admit I'm impressed by\Nhow well you know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might even have long-term\Npotential here, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:03:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to serve as\Nmy maid for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure not to disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, even when you were\Nlittle you were gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, you are adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I heard you insult me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you try to gloss over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's funny to think that Lene\Nhas always been this stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean that she's been so reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a huge help to\Nus at the fair, Instructor Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that goes without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to bother to learn a\Nnew skill, I demand to be the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get to servicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll service the crap out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.59,0:04:47.88,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.18,0:04:50.85,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.01,0:04:53.81,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.10,0:04:56.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me no hold on?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.99,0:04:59.95,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want you\Nto know what you want.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.98,0:05:06.00,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me? No hold on?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.32,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.32,0:05:12.21,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.21,0:05:14.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I want only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.33,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.17,0:05:20.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.77,0:05:24.09,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.09,0:05:26.59,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.60,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.47,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.47,0:05:40.71,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.35,0:05:43.32,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.32,0:05:47.11,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.11,0:05:52.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.07,0:05:53.95,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.95,0:05:56.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.70,0:06:00.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.00,0:06:02.79,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.79,0:06:05.42,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.42,0:06:09.30,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.14,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
