Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you look rather decent,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though I suppose servant's\Nclothing would suit a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my stars, Miss Claire just\Ngave me a real compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was insulting you, you rube!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Misha, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it suits you perfectly, Prince Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look quite handsome as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:06:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shift schedule's posted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We rotate between prepping and serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to take turns for breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you suppose we'll start\Nany time soon? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so ready for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, master, and welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you decided what you'd\Nlike to order, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring it right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, our finest roast\Nbeef sandwiches for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has everything been to\Nyour liking, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon, miss Claire, a\Ncustomer has requested you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't keep your customer\Nwaiting, miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Lene, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you had sufficient time to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! He-he-he!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you bottling the rage\Nin the name of professionalism!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, if you do not desist, I\Nwill not hesitate to slap you! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot I'm dealing\Nwith a complete degenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you like to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about the sandwich and\Ncreme brulee special, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And may I get you something\Nto drink with that as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tears on the rocks, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not test me, you little twit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you like to drink, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I recommend the hurry\Nand get out of my sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite refreshing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe just black tea after the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'd love a sight of\Nthat Miss Claire sweet stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're all out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that'll be all for today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I shall pledge\Nyour head as reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, can I add something\Nto my order, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall have your\Nvengeance one day, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come in, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Yu, do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I won't take...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not allow cutting in this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to be this busy. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some help, please? Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies for the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That took you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you make His\NHighness wait for service?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who this man is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the illustrious Crown\NPrince of the Empire of Loro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, His Imperial\NHighness, Marcel Loro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will take his order immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot about this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.68,0:10:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he stays true to the\Ngame, this is gonna suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me your finest\Ndish made with dodo bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His highness loves the dodo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to disappoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid we don't have\Nanything with dodo bird on our menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If his highness wants dodo,\Nthen you will bring it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me, sir, I wish I could,\Nbut it's a very rare delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not likely to find Dodo served\Nanywhere in the entire of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst.
