Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be rude and make impossible\Ndemands of the heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only there as a\Nchallenge in the game.
