Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.32,0:11:15.36,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,757.4)\fnBreezeSans\fs32\fsp2\b0\c&HF9F4F3&\1a&H46&\blur0.8}Rod
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is the part where I temporarily\Nregret not raising their affection levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so, so much worse, IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you expect me to go out into the\Nwilderness and tackle a dodo for you to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if that's the case,\Nif I have to wrestle a dodo...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.54,0:11:32.92,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,850)\fnBreezeSans\fs80\fsp2\bord3.2\c&HFFFEFE&\fad(232,1)}Speaking in Loronese
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my\Ninterruption, Prince Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.92,0:12:02.70,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,850)\fnBreezeSans\fs80\fsp2\bord3.2}Speaking in Loronese
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there is one among\Nyou fluent in lower knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your name, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire Francois, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might I make a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do serve an exotic dish\Nmade with a very rare sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For exclusive guests, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This item is so rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a select few have ever\Ntasted it here in Bower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain your highness will enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll trust your recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am delighted to hear you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe the\Nnerve of that narcissist?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I can't stand\Nthese new money monarchies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you make note?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pompous fools like him will\Nalways cave if you butter them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is valuable advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only for the advice,\Nbut for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I certainly didn't do it for\Nyou, if that's what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go serve him his egg\Nsandwich and leave me to my rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mayonnaise hasn't reached Loro yet,\Nso remind him that it's a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just remembering\Nsomething, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm fine\Nwearing the maid uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely unacceptable for anyone\Nwho serves me not to own a single gown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May we try this one on, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who allowed this commoner in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no place for your\Nkind to linger, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me a moment, but has my\Nservant done something imprudent?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.78,0:14:06.83,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,850)\fnBreezeSans\fs80\fsp2\bord3.2\fad(275,1)}Speaking in Loronese
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, fluent in Loranese at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be receiving a fine education.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.78,0:13:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the daughter of Dolph Red\NSwat and Minister of Finance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King LaSalle is introducing a policy\Nfor the betterment of commoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is indeed, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought her here to help the king\Nmeasure how far we still have left to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as a visiting dignitary, I suppose I\Nmust adhere to the King of Bowers' wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall overlook this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am delighted to hear you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to go through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid, irritating royals! Miss Clare?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monarchy of Loro is absolutely horrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare that prince mistreat\Na member of my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes you the highest-ranked\Ncommoner in this entire kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone treat you like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, as you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tipo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, take your break. My time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck out there big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you taking your break now, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did such a great\Njob handling customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.06,0:15:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why that's so surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Minister of Finance's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting on a front for people\Nis second nature to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for what it's worth, I prefer\Nit when you're your usual honest self.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing honest about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you before, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of what\Nkind of personality I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me sad to hear you talk\Nabout yourself so negatively.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not need your pity, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inviting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole fair out there\Njust waiting to be explored.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire, it'd be an honor to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where would you like to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No food or drinks, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to pollute my body with junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this one of your vile jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot you're afraid of ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was simply taken aback by your\Ninterest in something so juvenile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two students for the hell house, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, Art! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a haunted house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you need a little\Nsnuggle, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the ridiculous suggestions...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do seem to be wilting a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I go get you something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.92,0:17:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nothing silly or extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water will do just fine. A tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sign up to join a good cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Rae Taylor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The star commoner who got into the\NRoyal Academy at the top of her class?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I guess so, yeah. My name is Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a commoner here on\Nscholarship, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, want to join the commoner movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're currently trying to recruit\Nmore supporters to our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this is our flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.48,0:18:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you, and why are you filling my\Nservant's head with radical nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire Francois?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A movement seeking equality\Nbetween nobles and commoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool for committing\Nthis backwash to paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The audacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered what was keeping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't waste your\Ntime on those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I don't think\Ntheir beliefs are idiotic at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.44,0:18:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You agree with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:19:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wouldn't matter to me if\NI were a commoner or a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd still prefer to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I almost forgot. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an amulet. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A charm to help you\Nfind the love you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.24,0:19:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope things work out\Nbetween you and Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as confusing as\Nyou are frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.42,0:19:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as you might like\Nto tease and joke around,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you really mean it when you\Nsay that you're in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet you give me this, and support me\Ngetting together with Prince Thane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your happiness means the world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want that more than having\Nmy love for you returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the people out there, why\Nin the world would you choose me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're the one who\Nbrought my heart back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked myself to exhaustion every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life was all about the next deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could barely breathe from the pressure.
