Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(1313,432)\frz11.72\fax-0.13\fn01tama\fs34\c&H000200&\blur0.9}res
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(1372,421)\frz9.46\fax-0.06\fn01tama\fs34\c&H000200&\blur0.9}On
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(1403,416)\frz8.75\fax-0.06\fn01tama\fs34\c&H000200&\blur0.9}ly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there was no way to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But amid all that?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.44,0:20:21.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(372,920)\fnBreezeSans\fs46\b0\c&HFFF2CF&\blur0.8\fad(0,500)\clip(315,903,375,1030)\t(27,2029,\clip(315,903,1310,1030))}A mere commoner dares try to curry favor with me?\NKnow your place.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(375,750)\fnBreezeSans\fs35\fsp2\b0\bord3\c&H74391D&\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H0A&\3a&H0A&\blur0.8\fad(0,543)}Claire
Dialogue: 2,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.44,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(375,750)\fnBreezeSans\fs35\fsp2\b0\c&H74391D&\1a&H19&\blur0.8\fad(0,543)}Claire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.41,0:20:35.17,Signs_Nameplates,Text,0,0,0,,{\move(1675,354,1705,344.5,29,3741)\fn00426\fs80\fsp10\c&H10151C&\blur1\fad(1,1480)\t(29,3741,\fs83.5)}Claire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And chances are, you wouldn't\Nbelieve me if I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have all the\Nabsurd things for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly, you don't mean\Nto give me a real answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ought to head back anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.89,0:20:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.88,0:20:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire, please give me your...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm through playing pretend with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are a noble and a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more, and nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean that? Let's go.
