Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.04,0:22:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that I'm gonna be a person.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.61,0:22:18.84,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's important to shield your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.84,0:22:21.05,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}With a strong facade
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm thinking about your\Nheart, it's a big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what you've ever done.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.05,0:22:23.93,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}No one wishes for their fantasies to flourish,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.93,0:22:24.85,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Do they?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.85,0:22:28.02,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Are you shameless? Stop this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you've done.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.02,0:22:31.48,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Once again, I keep overreacting... you're annoying!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.71,0:22:37.67,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.64,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Someone who I could never meet in my world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.64,0:22:45.64,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}As we grow close to each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.64,0:22:50.56,ed_eng_07_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}My feelings keep growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.26,0:22:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten sheets of parchment, two bottles\Nof ink, and one ball of leather thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like we got all we need.\NWhy do we have to do the shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well it's part of our job Despite\Nthe name knights mostly run errands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.90,0:23:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and do office work fair day is\Nan exception There are so many
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.38,0:23:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,memories i'll treasure from fair\Nday like my date with miss claire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My looks like there's quite\Nthe commotion out here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loretta peppy Can you\Ntell me what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there was a fight between\None of the commoners and a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Hugh's attendant, Master Dede,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He attacked a student in\Nthe commoner movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it solved!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, by the name of Claire Francois!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.00,0:23:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing keeping me going\Nis the ability to tease you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.82,0:24:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loath as I am to admit it, I believe that.
